  m_Name: Inn Guestbook
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NoteData
  title: Inn Guestbook
  content: "Traveler's Guestbook\n\n\"Excellent stew. Comfortable beds.\"\n\u2014
    Merchant from Bloombridge\n\n\"Left my boots here last season. Found them exactly
    where I forgot them.\"\n\u2014 Surveyor\n\n\"Courier arrived after midnight and
    still somehow beat me here.\"\n\u2014 Caravan Guard\n\n\"Please stop feeding
    the birds from the upstairs windows.\"\n\u2014 Innkeeper"
